   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TAN Cultural Fund</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tanzanias Kulturfond</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector oriented cultural support to Tanzania: 1. Establishment supportof the first nation wide and autonomous Cultural Trust Fund in Tanzania (office investments); 2. Support to the recurrent admin. bud-get of the Fund; 3. Cultural Support handled by the Fund; 4. Consultancies (follow-up incl. the costs for the elected Swedishe Trustee).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sektorinriktat kulturst&#xF6;d till Tanzania: 1. St&#xF6;d till etablerandet av Tanzanias f&#xF6;rsta landsomfattande och oberoende kulturfond (kontors- investeringar). 2. Administrativt st&#xF6;d till driften av fonden; 3. Kulturst&#xF6;d (kanaliseat genom fonden) och 4. Konsultinsatser (uppf&#xF6;ljning, inklusive kostnader f&#xF6;r svensk styrelserepresentant).</narrative>
  </description>
